14.11. NVIDIA PARAKEET TRANSCRIPTION MODELS
      This Software may download, cache, or bundle NVIDIA Parakeet automatic 
      speech recognition (ASR) model weights, including but not limited to 
      nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v2 and nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3. These model 
      weights are separate components with their own license terms, and the 
      provisions of this Proprietary License do not apply to those model weights.

14.12. PARAKEET LICENSE TERMS (CC BY 4.0)
      NVIDIA Parakeet model weights remain subject to the Creative Commons 
      Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0) license regardless of this 
      Proprietary License. The CC BY 4.0 license requires appropriate credit to 
      NVIDIA, a link to the license, and indication of modifications where 
      applicable. The full attribution notice is in 
      licenses/nvidia-parakeet-cc-by-4.0.txt and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. The 
      license terms are available at 
      https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

14.13. PARAKEET MODEL SOURCES
      Official model cards and weights are published by NVIDIA at:
      - https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v2
      - https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3
      You may obtain model weights from those sources subject to CC BY 4.0.

14.14. NEMO TOOLKIT
      Transcription inference may use the NVIDIA NeMo toolkit, which is licensed 
      under the Apache License 2.0. NeMo is a separate component; see 
      https://github.com/NVIDIA/NeMo

14.15. PARAKEET ATTRIBUTION IN DISTRIBUTIONS
      Installers and runtime bundles that include Parakeet model weights also 
      include MODEL_ATTRIBUTION.txt in the transcription models directory, in 
      compliance with CC BY 4.0 attribution requirements.

